{
 "id": "person-moses-folk",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/person-moses-folk",
 "offset_seconds": -2.340000000000206,
 "words_heard": 250,
 "words": 253,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "His mother hid him three months long till she could hide no more",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She laid him in a papyrus basket by the Nile's reedy shore",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His sister watched from a distance as Pharaoh's daughter came",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I drew him out of the water, and Moses was his name",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He kept the flock of Jethro, and at Horeb's mountain height",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He saw a bush that burned but was not consumed, a great sight",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God called to him out of the bush, and he stood on holy ground",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD had seen his people's misery and heard their cry resound",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I AM WHO I AM",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I AM has sent me to you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let my people go",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On Sinai there was thunder and the mountain shook with fire",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The horn grew loud and louder as the smoke rose ever higher",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You shall have no other gods before me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I AM WHO I AM",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I AM has sent me to you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let my people go",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He climbed Mount Nebo, Pisgah's top, and looked across the land",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From Gilead as far as Dan, down to the Negev sand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have let you see it with your own eyes",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you will not cross over into it",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Moses, the servant of the LORD, died there in the land of Moab",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let my people go",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
